  "content": "<h1>更好的配方書</h1><p>為原版配方書添加釀造、鍛造以及生活品質改進功能！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/D7kcXWaZra\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/D7kcXWaZra</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbrb\" rel=\"nofollow\">請到 Modrinth 下載模組以獲得最佳體驗！</a></p><h2>功能特色</h2><h3><strong>釀造台配方書</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/73c81196-9563-4482-8d4e-b0b980ee8f12\" alt=\"一\"></p><h3><strong>鍛造台配方書</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/30f27b5b-7e4d-4c81-8229-33c0d8391783\" alt=\"二\"></p><h3><strong>釘選常用配方</strong></h3><p>使用快捷鍵將配方釘選至頂部</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/aadc51e7-68fa-42a2-9672-6deadd77b91e\" alt=\"三\"></p><h3><strong>一鍵合成切換</strong></h3><p>啟用後只需單擊即可合成，按住 Shift 則可盡量合成。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/cb8f0305-fea7-4547-8e91-ff0c17e25ada\" alt=\"四\"></p><h3><strong>查看未解鎖配方</strong></h3><p>可選擇查看尚未解鎖的配方。客戶端限定！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/6a4ebc98-a5ee-4271-97d0-b2af6f13a60a\" alt=\"圖片\"></p><h3><strong>取消分組配方</strong></h3><p>如果您喜歡釘選特定配方，這個功能非常實用！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/e8abc1f1-6b37-4447-895c-0c86a02d38d8\" alt=\"五_比較\"></p><h3><strong>還有更多……</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>使用滑鼠滾輪翻頁</li>\n<li>開啟配方書時保持合成介面置中</li>\n<li>顯示熔爐配方，讓您<em>真正</em>看見它們：</li>\n</ul><p><strong>現在</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/main/.github/images/furnace/now.png\" alt=\"現在\"></p><p><strong>以前</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/main/.github/images/furnace/then.png\" alt=\"以前\"></p><ul>\n<li>啟用或停用解鎖動畫</li>\n</ul><p>噢……你也可以完全關閉配方書，如果你願意的話。</p>",
